<title>USA: Goldman wins $34 mln of Arlington, Texas, bonds.</title>
<headline>Goldman wins $34 mln of Arlington, Texas, bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. said it won $33.9 million of Arlington, Texas, permanent improvement bonds, Series 1997, with true interest cost (TIC) of 4.92 percent.</p>
</text>
